    <!--
      Intentionally no <item> entries yet.

      Sparkle reads an empty channel as "you are up to date" and says so quietly. That is the
      correct state before the first release: the alternative — an <item> pointing at an
      iRecord.dmg that has not been uploaded — makes every update check fail on download.

      A missing file is worse still: this URL is baked into every shipped bundle, so a 404 here
      breaks "Check for Updates…" for every user, forever.

      scripts/release.sh REGENERATES this whole file on each release, so do not hand-edit it
      to add releases; run the script instead.
    -->

  </channel>
